> {ban,gr,ko,r=C3=A9,a}. The "r" is a syllabic consonant, which is ignored =
when
> placing stress.
>
> > Yes, I see that the explicit mark of accent is only needed for cmevla.
>
> True, though a cmavo can be accented on a non-default syllable and you ma=
y
